{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n乃木坂46の成人式の式典でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木神社さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初詣にも行ったばっかりなので\n頻繁にお世話になってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/11/3314080/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバムのイベントの方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人につき10名のファンのかたをご招待。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう自分のファンのかたはもちろんだけど\nみんな見たことある人ばっかり！w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"濃いファンのかたがたくさんいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/11/3314080/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも\n乃木坂の応援ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に\nファンのかた10名＋メンバー1人\nの11人で記念撮影！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーが振袖着て\n椅子に座って\nそれをみなさんが囲んで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真館とかで撮るような\n家族写真のようでした(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとでお写真ご自宅に届くと思うので\n待っててね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/11/3314080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振袖とかだいぶレアだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/11/3314080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事にしてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/11/3314080/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/11/3314080/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紫とゆーか紺とゆーか\n渋めな振袖。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田っぽい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}